course: dictionary
lesson: 11418
title: Acknowledge: admit, notice, thank
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Acknowledge is a verb with three main meanings. First, it means to admit that something is true: «Sam acknowledged that he had broken the vase.» Sam did not hide it. He said yes, it was true.
explain: Second, it means to show that you have noticed or received something: «The shop assistant gave me a nod to acknowledge that I had walked in.» She let me know she had seen me. In letters, «We acknowledge receipt of your letter» means we got it.
explain: Third, it means to thank or give credit to someone publicly: «The author acknowledged her teacher on the first page of the book.» Use the swap check: if admit, notice or thank fits the sentence, you have found its meaning.
fact: Acknowledge is a verb. Its forms are acknowledge, acknowledges, acknowledged and acknowledging.
fact: «Acknowledge» can mean to admit that something is true, such as a mistake.
fact: «Acknowledge» can mean to show you have noticed someone, such as with a wave or a nod.
fact: «Acknowledge» can mean to thank or give credit to someone, especially in public, such as in a book or speech.
fact: Useful phrases: acknowledge a mistake, acknowledge receipt of a letter, acknowledge someone's help.
exercise: «Lucy acknowledged that her answer was wrong.» What does acknowledged mean here? | *Admitted it was true | Forgot all about it | Argued until the end | Rubbed it out
exercise: «The shop assistant gave me a nod to acknowledge that I had walked in.» What does acknowledge mean here? | Asked me to leave | *Showed that she had noticed me | Hid from me | Paid me for the goods
exercise: A school report says: «We gratefully acknowledge Mr Patel for his help with the play.» What does the school do for Mr Patel? | Forgets his help | Sells his help | *Thanks him publicly for his help | Hides his help
test: «Amir did not acknowledge Ben in the corridor.» What does this suggest? | Amir hugged Ben | Amir won a prize | Amir was lost in the corridor | *Amir ignored Ben
test: Which word could replace acknowledge in «I must acknowledge my mistake»? | Forget | Copy | *Admit | Hide
exam: Mia writes, «I acknowledge receipt of your letter.» What does acknowledge receipt mean? | To write a new letter | To lose the letter | To post a letter back | *To say that you have received the letter
